        "original_id": "5d02b84a-0426-5378-8571-09e4c8ae52ce",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: The Fighting Irish, Horrible Bosses, Hall Pass, We're the Millers, Horrible Bosses 2, Sleeping with Other People, Tumbledown, The Book of Love, Race\n- People: Jason Sudeikis, Dan Bakkedahl, Katrina Bowden, Henry Boyle, Anna Chlumsky, Siobhan Fallon Hogan, Chris Hoch, Alice Kremelberg, Nathan Lane, Boris McGiver, John F Mooney, Brian Murray, Maulik Pancholy, Lonny Ross, Molly Shannon, Kristen Sudeikis\n- Topics: Air dates, guest stars, filmography\n\nFacts:\n- The Fighting Irish aired in the United States on March 8, 2007.\n- Dan Bakkedahl, Katrina Bowden, Henry Boyle, Anna Chlumsky, Siobhan Fallon Hogan, Chris Hoch, Alice Kremelberg, Nathan Lane, Boris McGiver, John F. Mooney, Brian Murray, Maulik Pancholy, Lonny Ross, Molly Shannon, Jason Sudeikis, and Kristen Sudeikis guest-starred in The Fighting Irish.\n- Jason Sudeikis starred in Horrible Bosses and Hall Pass in 2011.\n- Jason Sudeikis starred in We're the Millers in 2013.\n- Jason Sudeikis starred in Horrible Bosses 2 in 2014.\n- Jason Sudeikis starred in Sleeping with Other People and Tumbledown in 2015.\n- Jason Sudeikis starred in The Book of Love and Race in 2016.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
